{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56512","headline":"巨胜歌（幷序） 一 · 柳冲用","name":"巨胜歌（幷序） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九鼎何所自，都因一炁生。\n银铅看得所，龙虎自呑幷。\n铢两相句制，河车辨性情。\n循还依节候，还丹应可成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳冲用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}